---
description: Route Perplexity tasks into the correct mode without silently escalating cost or depth.
alwaysApply: false
---

- This repository exposes four separate Perplexity modes: Search only, Pro Search, Deep Research, and Fetch URL.
- Use Search only for links, snippets, and source discovery.
- Use Pro Search for concise sourced answers with `search_type=pro`.
- Use Deep Research only when broad multi-source analysis is explicitly needed.
- Use Fetch URL for reading one or more known URLs.
- Keep mode boundaries explicit and do not silently switch one mode into another.
- Preferred MCP path for Search only is `perplexity_search`.
- Search only fallback command: `python3 perplexity_search_only/scripts/search_only.py "<query>" --json`
- Pro Search command: `python3 perplexity-pro-search/scripts/pro_search.py "<query>" --context-size medium --json`
- Fetch URL command: `python3 perplexity-fetch-url-content/scripts/fetch_url_content.py <url> [url ...] --json`
